    title: "Ball Bearing Hinges vs Plain Bearing Hinges: A Buyer's Guide",
    excerpt:
      "The wrong bearing type on a high-traffic door means noise, wear, and complaints within a year. Here's how to decide between the two.",
    category: "Buying Guide",
