    title: "How Concealed Cabinet Hinges Are Made: A Manufacturing Walkthrough",
    excerpt:
      "From cold-forged cups to the soft-close damper mechanism, here's what actually happens on the production line for a modern concealed hinge.",
    category: "Manufacturing",
